# Host tests

Run the deterministic firmware-logic tests on any host with a C++11 compiler:

```sh
./test/run_host_tests.sh
```

The tests cover the shared matrix/DAT format logic, controls, IR command mapping,
and button debounce. They do not emulate Arduino, SD hardware, NeoPixels, or IR
receiver timing; those require the hands-on checks listed in the root README.
